{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBFdyfq9g1SeWq9a6prnLn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Docker-Mailserver Project\n2\t\n3\t> 🔀 **Session history (refocus)**: See [docs/refocus/INDEX.md](docs/refocus/INDEX.md) for incoming briefs and outbound spawns.\n4\t\n5\t## ✅ Current Status: FULLY OPERATIONAL\n6\t\n7\tProduction mail server using Docker-Mailserver (single container solution) for ai-servicers.com domain.\n8\tSuccessfully integrated with Nextcloud Mail app and accessible via external domain.\n9\t\n10\t## Working Configuration\n11\t\n12\t### Mail Accounts\n13\t- **websurfinmurf@ai-servicers.com** - Active and working\n14\t- **michaelmurphy@ai-servicers.com** - Configured (legacy)\n15\t\n16\t### Access Methods\n17\t- **External**: mail.ai-servicers.com (via Traefik with Let's Encrypt SSL)\n18\t- **Internal**: mailserver (container name on Docker network)\n19\t- **IMAP/SSL**: Port 993\n20\t- **SMTP/STARTTLS**: Port 587\n21\t- **Submission**: Port 587\n22\t- **SMTP**: Port 25 (incoming)\n23\t\n24\t### SSL Configuration\n25\t- **Type**: manual\n26\t- **Certificates**: Let's Encrypt via Traefik\n27\t- **Path**: `/certs/certificate.crt` and `/certs/privatekey.key`\n28\t- **Mount**: `/home/administrator/projects/data/traefik-certs/ai-servicers.com:/certs:ro`\n29\t\n30\t## Architecture\n31\t- **Container**: ghcr.io/docker-mailserver/docker-mailserver:latest\n32\t- **Management UI**: PostfixAdmin at postfixadmin.linuxserver.lan\n33\t- **Database**: PostgreSQL (shared instance) for PostfixAdmin\n34\t- **Routing**: Through Traefik reverse proxy for external access\n35\t- **Networks**: mailserver-net, traefik-net, postgres-net\n36\t\n37\t## Configuration Files\n38\t- `$HOME/projects/secrets/docker-mailserver.env` - Main environment configuration\n39\t- `config/postfix-accounts.cf` - Account configuration (managed by setup command)\n40\t- `config/postfix-virtual.cf` - Virtual aliases configuration\n41\t- `config/dovecot/` - Custom Dovecot configurations\n42\t\n43\t## Key Environment Settings\n44\t```env\n45\tHOSTNAME=mail\n46\tDOMAINNAME=ai-servicers.com\n47\tPERMIT_DOCKER=network\n48\tSSL_TYPE=manual\n49\tSSL_CERT_PATH=/certs/certificate.crt\n50\tSSL_KEY_PATH=/certs/privatekey.key\n51\tTLS_LEVEL=intermediate\n52\tENABLE_SPAMASSASSIN=1\n53\tENABLE_FAIL2BAN=1\n54\tENABLE_POSTGREY=1\n55\t```\n56\t\n57\t## Network Configuration\n58\t- Connected to three networks for full integration:\n59\t  - `mailserver-net` - Primary network\n60\t  - `traefik-net` - For external access via Traefik"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4887fea5-78a1-4b14-a071-ae362ca71a13","uuid":"b8157aaa-6273-4541-b7c6-eb90e6a60412","timestamp":"2026-07-28T13:55:13.500Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/administrator/projects/docker-mailserver/CLAUDE.md","content":"# Docker-Mailserver Project\n\n> 🔀 **Session history (refocus)**: See [docs/refocus/INDEX.md](docs/refocus/INDEX.md) for incoming briefs and outbound spawns.\n\n## ✅ Current Status: FULLY OPERATIONAL\n\nProduction mail server using Docker-Mailserver (single container solution) for ai-servicers.com domain.\nSuccessfully integrated with Nextcloud Mail app and accessible via external domain.\n\n## Working Configuration\n\n### Mail Accounts\n- **websurfinmurf@ai-servicers.com** - Active and working\n- **michaelmurphy@ai-servicers.com** - Configured (legacy)\n\n### Access Methods\n- **External**: mail.ai-servicers.com (via Traefik with Let's Encrypt SSL)\n- **Internal**: mailserver (container name on Docker network)\n- **IMAP/SSL**: Port 993\n- **SMTP/STARTTLS**: Port 587\n- **Submission**: Port 587\n- **SMTP**: Port 25 (incoming)\n\n### SSL Configuration\n- **Type**: manual\n- **Certificates**: Let's Encrypt via Traefik\n- **Path**: `/certs/certificate.crt` and `/certs/privatekey.key`\n- **Mount**: `/home/administrator/projects/data/traefik-certs/ai-servicers.com:/certs:ro`\n\n## Architecture\n- **Container**: ghcr.io/docker-mailserver/docker-mailserver:latest\n- **Management UI**: PostfixAdmin at postfixadmin.linuxserver.lan\n- **Database**: PostgreSQL (shared instance) for PostfixAdmin\n- **Routing**: Through Traefik reverse proxy for external access\n- **Networks**: mailserver-net, traefik-net, postgres-net\n\n## Configuration Files\n- `$HOME/projects/secrets/docker-mailserver.env` - Main environment configuration\n- `config/postfix-accounts.cf` - Account configuration (managed by setup command)\n- `config/postfix-virtual.cf` - Virtual aliases configuration\n- `config/dovecot/` - Custom Dovecot configurations\n\n## Key Environment Settings\n```env\nHOSTNAME=mail\nDOMAINNAME=ai-servicers.com\nPERMIT_DOCKER=network\nSSL_TYPE=manual\nSSL_CERT_PATH=/certs/certificate.crt\nSSL_KEY_PATH=/certs/privatekey.key\nTLS_LEVEL=intermediate\nENABLE_SPAMASSASSIN=1\nENABLE_FAIL2BAN=1\nENABLE_POSTGREY=1\n```\n\n## Network Configuration\n- Connected to three networks for full integration:\n  - `mailserver-net` - Primary network\n  - `traefik-net` - For external access via Traefik","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":256}}}
